DTSTAMP:20260722T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20260811T100000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20260811T103000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=11
SUMMARY:File GSTR-1 (Sales / Outward Supplies data) - DUE BY 11th
DESCRIPTION:File GSTR-1 with sales (outward supply) data for the previous month. Statutory due date is the 11th.\n\nAccount: accounts@crownesthospitality (verify correct email)\nDeadline: on/before 11th of every month
