DTSTAMP:20260722T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20260820T100000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20260820T103000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=20
SUMMARY:File GSTR-3B (Summary return + tax payment) - DUE BY 20th
DESCRIPTION:File GSTR-3B summary return and pay GST for the previous month. Statutory due date is the 20th.\n\nAccount: accounts@crownesthospitality (verify correct email)\nDeadline: on/before 20th of every month
CATEGORIES:GST,Compliance
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GSTR-3B due in 4 days (due 20th)
TRIGGER:-P4D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GSTR-3B due TOMORROW (20th)
TRIGGER:-P1D
